  "titleBlock": {
    "company": "ST185 Celica (living-relation)",
    "title": "ST185-WheelSpeed-Rear - rear wheel speed harness: RL / RR ABS sensors to the rear VRC and the IX_WS_REAR inline",
    "drawingNumber": "ST185-WheelSpeed-Rear"
  },
  "exportNotes": "Ident bands (DECISIONS R87): every wire carries its circuit's code in Blue / Yellow / White bands (RNF-100, 6 mm) at every end - connector, terminal, splice and break - band 1 next to the end. Circuit per wire: Connections 'Ident' column and HARNESS-BUILD-LIST.csv. Codes: WSS_RL White; WSS_RR Blue-Blue; VRC_R_DRAIN Yellow-Yellow; VRC_R_5V Blue-Yellow; VRC_R_GND Blue-White. Labels: printed TMS-SCE marker on each bundle end: RL WSS / RR WSS at the sensor plugs, IX WS REAR at the inline (the VRC plugs keep their VRC-IN / VRC-OUT markers).",
