        "x": 420,
        "y": 120
      }
    }
  ],
  "schematicNotes": [
    {
      "id": "n_scope",
      "width": 390,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 150
      },
      "text": "REAR WHEEL SPEED - two pieces, no drawn link, no bulkhead. IN: RL / RR ABS cables -> IN plug lp16_vrc_r_in. OUT: OUT plug lp16_vrc_r_out -> screened 4-core cable -> 6-way inline IX_WS_REAR (DT04-6P) near the ECU. VRC and its box not drawn (enclosure build)."
    },
    {
      "id": "n_shield",
      "width": 390,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 420
      },
      "text": "SHIELD: one screen node, grounded once at the ECU. Sensor screens float at the sensor, splice by the IN plug, drain to IN pin 3. Output screen: OUT pin 5 -> inline pin 5. No shell or case landings."
    },
    {
      "id": "n_notes_doc",
      "width": 270,
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 1260,
        "y": 0
      },
      "text": "Full notes - VRC plug pinouts and parts, drain build method, isolation, powder coat: docs/harness/HARNESS-NOTES.md, ST185-WheelSpeed-Rear."
    }
  ],
